%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=2014+MU69&amp;rft.pub=Minor+Planet+Center&amp;rft.date=2014-10-22&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.minorplanetcenter.net%2Fdb&#95;search%2Fshow&#95;object%3Futf8%3D%25E2%259C%2593%26object&#95;id%3D2014%2BMU69&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fko.wikipedia.org%3A486958+%EC%95%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%BD%94%ED%8A%B8\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Lakdawalla2014-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Lakdawalla2014_2-0\">가</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-Lakdawalla2014_2-1\">나</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\">Lakdawalla, Emily (2014년 10월 15일). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20141015230432/http://www.planetary.org/blogs/emily-lakdawalla/2014/10151024-finally-new-horizons-has-a-kbo.html\">&#8220;Finally! New Horizons has a second target&#8221;</a>. &#12298;행성협회 블로그&#12299;. <a href=\"/wiki/%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1%ED%98%91%ED%9A%8C\" title=\"행성협회\">행성협회</a>. 2014년 10월 15일에 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.planetary.org/blogs/emily-lakdawalla/2014/10151024-finally-new-horizons-has-a-kbo.html\">원본 문서</a>에서 보존된 문서<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. 2015년 6월 22일에 확인함</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1%ED%98%91%ED%9A%8C+%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8&amp;rft.atitle=Finally%21+New+Horizons+has+a+second+target&amp;rft.date=2014-10-15&amp;rft.aulast=Lakdawalla&amp;rft.aufirst=Emily&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.planetary.org%2Fblogs%2Femily-lakdawalla%2F2014%2F10151024-finally-new-horizons-has-a-kbo.html&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fko.wikipedia.org%3A486958+%EC%95%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%BD%94%ED%8A%B8\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cit